<title>USA: Novatek files Chapter 11 bankruptcy.</title>
<headline>Novatek files Chapter 11 bankruptcy.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novatek International Inc said on Thursday it had filed for protection under Chapter 11 of the U.S. Bancruptcy Code,</p>
<p>The company said it took the action, on October 25, in order to preserve shareholder value, protect its rights under licensing agreements, and cooperate with the Securities and Exchange Commission in its investigation of certain corporate activities.</p>
<p>It gave no details.</p>
</text>
